<title>HONG KONG: CKI to invest in N. China power projects.</title>
<headline>CKI to invest in N. China power projects.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Cheung Kong Infrastructure Holdings Ltd unit had signed agreements on the cooperative operation of three China thermal power projects, Chinese officials said.</p>
<p>The Hong Kong company would invest 450 million for a cooperation period of 20 years in the 745-million-yuan projects in Fushun city in northern China's Liaoning province, the municipal planning commission said in a statement sent to Reuters on Thursday. -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
